/// Epoch-1 compiler IR wire: the six manager carriers of PROP-054 §7.4/§14.6,
/// frozen from the landed R3 domain types. One whole value of the level
/// being passed crosses per invocation (`##WHOLE-IR-WIRE`); source/document
/// are one addressed document, documents is the explicit document batch,
/// closure/lane/emitted are one complete final artifact (`##IR-LEVELS`, SPEC-
