/// only IR shape exists. TWO metadata sets sit below and must not be confused:
/// `x-conversion-gates` is what the strict domain decoder OWES on every carrier
/// it is handed, including one a plugin transformed and returned; `x-corpus-
/// producer-oracles` is characterization of what THIS corpus's builtin passes
/// emitted. A plugin may legally return a verifier-valid closure whose anchors
/// the builtin `qualify` would have spelled differently or whose order the
